<#c83c78>DARK FORCE</>
Mimic Doll (1 bar)		^X
  Her shadow double appears and copies her attacks for a
  few seconds. X again ends it early.

<#c83c78>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Grab		^Y
  Back+Y throws the other way. Works in the air too.
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Dash / Back Step		_F_F / _B_B
High Jump		_D_U

<#c83c78>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Sweep		_DF^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Pounce (opponent down)		_U^A / ^B / ^C

<#c83c78>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the ES version (half a bar).
Soul Flash (air too)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Shining Blade		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  Also works out of block (guard cancel).
Merry Turn		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Mystic Arrow (command grab)		_F_DF_D_DB^A / ^B / ^C

<#c83c78>SUPERS</>
Luminous Illusion (1 bar, air too)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A_+^B
Splendor Love (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A_+^B
Gloomy Puppet Show (3 bars)		_F_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
  Any two of A/B/C work for the 1-bar supers.
